      "releaseNotes": "What's new?\n- The planner now remembers whether you chose \"Add to end\" or \"Add along the way\" for the next waypoint you add.\n- It's now easier to plan a route that retraces your steps.\n\nBug fixes\n- Fixed several translation and display issues.\n- Fixed an issue where the post-activity flow could become unresponsive.",
